<section id="geo" class="bg-dim">
  <div class="container split rev">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">File 06 &middot; Privacy-safe measurement</div>
      <h2>Geo Lift Solution</h2>
      <p class="muted">As data-privacy regulation makes attribution modelling harder, randomized control tests — a
        concept borrowed from pharma — are becoming a strong alternative. An exposed group is served ads while a
        holdout group is not; the holdout provides the baseline against which the intervention's efficiency is
        measured.</p>
      <p class="muted">RainMan deploys machine learning to implement Geo Lift solutions across regions or markets,
        measuring the effect of every contact point on incremental sales.</p>
    </div>
